  m_Name: ArcadeGameRailrush
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 124
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Railrush
  Description: 'Urchins only - a joust on rails. Grind a rail where it wears your colour and you fly
    fast; a spike flies at its own speed plus yours, so a volley thrown off the open end of
    a rail reaches three times as far as one thrown at cruise. Ride, launch, and lance a
    rival - every spike in a rival hull is a hit. Spike the road ahead to make a hostile
    third yours. Higher intensities grow the burrs on the launch lines into bigger cover.
    First team to the target wins.'
